Sun Nov  8 16:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package, built from the kanjitalk755/macemu fork (the
  maintained upstream; also used by Debian) at commit f532be3d
  (2026-10-21)
  * SDL2 video/audio, GTK3 prefs editor, BIN/CUE and VDE support
  * macemu-system-tinyxml2.patch: use the system tinyxml2, adapted
    from Debian's 1001_use_system_tinyxml2.patch
  * Add .desktop file and 256x256 icon taken from SheepShaver.icns

